  {
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "Tick-to-trade funnel (selected time range)",
   "id": 13,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "velocita-v2-prometheus"
   },
   "description": "Every stage counted from the edge's metrics for the dashboard's time range. 1 -> 2: True Markets re-sends its last price every second; only a newer price is a tick. 3: the cluster committed a decision frame (shadow_recorded). 4: the rule matched an enter/exit action and the kernel sized a bounded order. 5: what the kernel authorized: always 0 in shadow mode, by design.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 16,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 25
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(increase(velocita_shadow_messages_total{strategy=\"stochastic\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "1  TM messages received",
     "refId": "A",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(increase(velocita_shadow_messages_total{strategy=\"stochastic\",outcome=\"tick\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "2  New BTC prices sent to the cluster",
     "refId": "B",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(increase(velocita_shadow_decisions_total{strategy=\"stochastic\",decision_code=\"17\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "3  Decisions recorded by the kernel",
     "refId": "C",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(increase(velocita_shadow_directives_total{strategy=\"stochastic\",stage=\"proposed\",directive!=\"no_action\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "4  Trades proposed by the strategy",
     "refId": "D",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum(increase(velocita_shadow_directives_total{strategy=\"stochastic\",stage=\"effective\",directive!=\"no_action\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "5  Trades authorized by the kernel",
     "refId": "E",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "decimals": 0,
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "blue",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "color",
    "namePlacement": "left",
    "sizing": "auto",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "6  Venue executor  ->  7  TrueMarkets",
   "id": 14,
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 16,
    "y": 25
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Not built yet, so nothing reaches TrueMarkets.**\n\n- Phase 1 (running): decisions are recorded, never authorized (shadow).\n- Phase 2: gateway + a TrueMarkets *simulator* (measures tick-to-trade; see Paper trading).\n- Live orders need M4-M7 and venue keys; no host holds a key.\n\nA proposal every tick is expected: in shadow no order ever fills, so the strategy never holds the position it asks for."
   }
  },
